OL,3,GNEWSATrust celebrates 40 years helping
OL,4,Aautistic adults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Birmingham charity is marking 40
OL,7,Fyears of helping adults with learning
OL,8,Fdisabilities and autistic adults live
OL,9,Fmore independent, fulfilling lives.
OL,11,FThe Lisieux Trust, founded in 1986, is
OL,12,Fbringing back staff, volunteers and the
OL,13,Ffounders who set up the charity in a
OL,14,Fcelebration on Saturday.
OL,16,FNick Horton, from Sutton Coldfield,
OL,17,Flives in supported accommodation and
OL,18,Fhas been assisted by the organisation
OL,19,Ffor 12 years.
